{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"14":"Fasting (Kitab Al-Siyam)"},"section_detail":{"14":{"hadithnumber_first":2313,"hadithnumber_last":2476,"arabicnumber_first":2313,"arabicnumber_last":2476,"name_native":"كتاب الصيام"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2435,"arabicnumber":2435,"text":"حدثنا موسى بن اسماعيل، حدثنا حماد، عن محمد بن عمرو، عن ابي سلمة، عن ابي هريرة، عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم بمعناه . زاد كان يصومه الا قليلا بل كان يصومه كله","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Hasan Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":14,"hadith":123}}]}